2310:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jidctint.c **** /*
2311:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jidctint.c ****  * Perform dequantization and inverse DCT on one block of coefficients,
2312:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jidctint.c ****  * producing a 15x15 output block.
2313:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jidctint.c ****  *
2314:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jidctint.c ****  * Optimized algorithm with 22 multiplications in the 1-D kernel.
2315:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jidctint.c ****  * cK represents sqrt(2) * cos(K*pi/30).
2316:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jidctint.c ****  */
